{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "IDnow",
  "abstract": "Munich-based identity verification and trust services provider, majority owned by Corsair since 2025. Products cover document and biometric verification, eID schemes and EUDI wallets, authentication for ongoing access using biometrics, OTPs and device intelligence, fraud prevention against deepfakes, synthetic identities and account takeover, and electronic signatures, seals and qualified attestations. Not a login or federation provider: no OpenID Connect or SSO is documented. Lists NIS2, TISAX, PVID, ISAE 3402 Type 2, DORA, GDPR and ISO/IEC 27001:2022.",
